{
  "id": "776",
  "title": "Split the Bill",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2020-01-15",
  "synopsis": "He Jing and Lili are discussing how to pay a restaurant bill.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/776/fa0ad5986b03bcf70f17d3850b0b660240504d52.mp3?1578921075",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "AA制\n\n何京：服务员，买单！\n服务员：好的，请问您是要一起付，还是分开付？\n何京：一起付，刷卡！\n丽丽：那怎么行，上次是你请的，这次应该我来付。服务员，刷我的卡！\n何京：不行不行，你还是学生，怎么能要你请客呢？\n丽丽：那也不能总是要你请客啊。那我们AA制吧！服务员，我付我的那一份。\n何京：真是拗不过你，好吧！我们AA制！",
    "traditional": "AA制\n\n何京：服務員，買單！\n服務員：好的，請問您是要一起付，還是分開付？\n何京：一起付，刷卡！\n麗麗：那怎麼行，上次是你請的，這次應該我來付。服務員，刷我的卡！\n何京：不行不行，你還是學生，怎麼能要你請客呢？\n麗麗：那也不能總是要你請客啊。那我們AA制吧！服務員，我付我的那一份。\n何京：真是拗不過你，好吧！我們AA制！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "To Split the Bill"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "何京：服务员，买单！",
      "traditional": "何京：服務員，買單！",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng fú wù yuán mǎi dān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: Waiter, we want to pay the bill!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "服务员：好的，请问您是要一起付，还是分开付？",
      "traditional": "服務員：好的，請問您是要一起付，還是分開付？",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán hǎo de qǐng wèn nín shì yào yì qǐ fù hái shi fēn kāi fù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Ok, may I ask if you are paying for all of it together, or paying separately?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "何京：一起付，刷卡！",
      "traditional": "何京：一起付，刷卡！",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng yì qǐ fù shuā kǎ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: I’m paying for all of it together, by card!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那怎么行，上次是你请的，这次应该我来付。服务员，刷我的卡！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那怎麼行，上次是你請的，這次應該我來付。服務員，刷我的卡！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà zěn me xíng shàng cì shì nǐ qǐng de zhè cì yīng gāi wǒ lái fù fú wù yuán shuā wǒ de kǎ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: How would that do. You treated me last time, I should pay this time. Waiter, charge my card!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "何京：不行不行，你还是学生，怎么能要你请客呢？",
      "traditional": "何京：不行不行，你還是學生，怎麼能要你請客呢？",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng bù xíng bù xíng nǐ hái shì xué sheng zěn me néng yào nǐ qǐng kè ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: That’s out of the question. You’re still a student, how could I ask you to treat me to dinner?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那也不能总是要你请客啊。那我们AA制吧！服务员，我付我的那一份。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那也不能總是要你請客啊。那我們AA制吧！服務員，我付我的那一份。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà yě bù néng zǒng shì yào nǐ qǐng kè a nà wǒ men A A zhì ba fú wù yuán wǒ fù wǒ de nà yí fèn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I also can’t always ask you to treat me to dinner. Then we'll split the bill! Waiter, I will pay for my meal."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "何京：真是拗不过你，好吧！我们AA制！",
      "traditional": "何京：真是拗不過你，好吧！我們AA制！",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng zhēn shì niù bú guò nǐ hǎo ba wǒ men A A zhì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: You really can’t be beaten when it comes to stubbornness. Alright! We’ll split the bill!"
    }
  ],
